---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /stays/
title: Every stay
description: Twelve places to sleep across six destinations, from a Lofoten fishing cabin to an overwater villa in the Maldives.
---

<section class="pagehead">
  <p class="label">Twelve rooms, six hours apart</p>
  <h1 class="pagehead__title">Every stay</h1>
  <p class="pagehead__lede">
    Sorted by the hour of their destination rather than by price, so the list
    reads as a single day. Nightly rates are for two people in high season
    unless the sleeps count says otherwise.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="index-table" data-reveal>
    {%- for d in destinations %}
      {%- for s in d.stays %}
      <a class="index-row" href="/destinations/{{ d.slug }}/#{{ s.name | slug }}">
        <span class="index-row__time">{{ d.time }}</span>
        <span class="index-row__name">{{ s.name }}</span>
        <span class="index-row__place">{{ d.name }}, {{ d.country }}</span>
        <span class="index-row__type">{{ s.type }}</span>
        <span class="index-row__price">{{ s.price | money }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
